    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "\nconst v=$input.first().json;\nconst news=$('Select Relevant News').first().json;\nconst rawPrices=$('Fetch Market Data').first()?.json || {};\nconst prices=(rawPrices.error || !Object.keys(rawPrices).length) ? {status:'Data unavailable', reason:String(rawPrices.error?.message || rawPrices.error || 'empty response')} : rawPrices;\nreturn [{json:{dateET:new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US',{timeZone:'America/New_York',weekday:'long',year:'numeric',month:'long',day:'numeric'}),generatedAt:news.generatedAt,stories:news.stories,marketData:prices,marketDataWarning:'Do not infer that this endpoint contains all requested benchmarks. Quote timestamp and previous-close status are mandatory. Omit unverified values.'}}];\n"
      },
      "id": "edb810f6-2427-4503-9038-2b6bedf067cb",
      "name": "Prepare Research Payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        430,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $env.OPENAI_API_KEY }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({model:'gpt-4o',temperature:0.2,max_tokens:16000,response_format:{type:'json_object'},messages:[{role:'system',content:\"You are Martha 2.0, an accessible but rigorous investment research educator for a sophomore Spelman Economics student and Project ACCLAIM technology analyst ($4.9M fund, Russell 1000 equity benchmark). Create TWO publication-quality, self-contained HTML documents to render as PDFs. Return ONLY a JSON object with keys snapshot_html and intelligence_html; each value must be a full HTML document with embedded CSS, no external assets or scripts. US Letter page, print margins 0.55in, readable typography, restrained navy/teal palette, clear tables, concise paragraphs, small SVG/CSS diagrams where helpful, page breaks to target exactly TWO pages for snapshot and FIVE to SIX pages for intelligence. Use page-break-after strategically; avoid oversized blank areas. Images only if trustworthy licensed URLs provided; prefer inline SVG educational diagrams. Use input news as research leads, NOT proof of article contents; never claim to have read paywalled/full stories based only on headlines. Source every major claim with linked dated source from input; if unavailable say 'Unverified: requires primary-source check'. Never invent quotes, prices, IPO valuations or market changes. Quotes from marketData only, label exact as-of timestamps and market session; if marketData empty or erroneous show 'Data unavailable' instead of made-up numbers. Separate fact, management guidance, analyst forecast, rumor, and Martha's hypothesis. Prioritize: global markets, global IPO read-through to Anthropic/OpenAI only with caveats, private markets, US indices and sector rotation, fixed-income sentiment (1\\u20133 sentences snapshot), tech/AI/communications (hyperscaler CapEx vs AI ARR/free cash flow/ROIC, NVIDIA/AMD/TSMC, HBM DRAM NAND, enterprise SaaS, cybersecurity, SpaceX/Starlink vs carriers), separate macro, and 2\\u20133 cross-market connections with mechanisms. Define jargon on first use; detailed report includes 3\\u20135 finance terms, bull/bear and thesis-changing evidence, 3 ACCLAIM questions. For Friday/weekends show last cash close clearly. Do not fill space with fabricated details; transparently report missing evidence. Output valid JSON with HTML strings and no markdown fences.\"},{role:'user',content:JSON.stringify($json)}]}) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "0d1ea57f-7913-41a0-a4c7-e325a29414ba",
      "name": "Martha Research and HTML",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        650,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "\nconst response=$input.first().json;\nlet raw=response.choices?.[0]?.message?.content;\nif(!raw) throw new Error('OpenAI returned no HTML JSON');\nif(response.choices[0].finish_reason==='length') throw new Error('OpenAI output was cut off at max_tokens; shorten the reports or raise max_tokens');\nraw=raw.trim().replace(/^```(?:json)?\\s*/i,'').replace(/\\s*```$/,'');\nconst doc=JSON.parse(raw);\nfor(const key of ['snapshot_html','intelligence_html']) if(!doc[key]?.includes('<html')) throw new Error('Missing '+key);\nconst snap=await this.helpers.prepareBinaryData(Buffer.from(doc.snapshot_html,'utf8'),'index.html','text/html');\nconst long=await this.helpers.prepareBinaryData(Buffer.from(doc.intelligence_html,'utf8'),'index.html','text/html');\nreturn [{json:{generatedAt:new Date().toISOString()},binary:{snapshotHtml:snap,intelligenceHtml:long}}];\n"
      },
